sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Ad as Administrator
  participant CLI as send_alerts.py
  participant Disp as AlertDispatcher
  participant Repo as WatchlistRepository
  participant N as Notifier
  actor Rec as Alert recipient
  Ad->>CLI: Run send_alerts.py, with --send to deliver
  CLI->>Disp: dispatch()
  Disp->>Repo: actionable_decisions() CONFIRMED only
  Disp->>Repo: Alerts already sent
  loop Each confirmed decision not yet alerted
    Disp->>Disp: Check again that it is CONFIRMED
    Disp->>Disp: render() with operator and signals
    alt Sending enabled
      Disp->>N: send(alert) by console, SMTP or Twilio
      N->>Rec: E-mail or SMS
      Disp->>Repo: Write alert_sent audit event
    else Dry run
      Disp-->>CLI: Show what would be sent
    end
  end
  Disp-->>CLI: Dispatch report
  CLI-->>Ad: Summary
